# Grill me (Plan mode default)

In **Plan mode**, read **`.cursor/skills/grill-me/SKILL.md`** at session start before drafting a plan.

## Required opening

Offer the user:

1. **Grill me** (default) — question-by-question until decisions are shared.
2. **Work with assumptions** — skip grilling; document assumptions and proceed.

## Rules

- One question at a time; include a recommended answer when grilling.
- Explore the codebase (readonly) instead of asking answerable questions.
- **Work with assumptions** is an explicit opt-out — honor it; list assumptions with `[needs validation]` on risky items.
- No file writes during Plan mode (see [docs/agent-sops/plan.md](../../docs/agent-sops/plan.md)).

Force this workflow: `@.cursor/rules/grill-me-plan.mdc` or `@.cursor/skills/grill-me/SKILL.md`.
